  "words": "WORD_LEVEL_TIMESTAMPS.json",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "You're falling from 10 kilometers above the ground.",
    "start": 0.4,
    "end": 3.45
   },
   {
    "text": "Your parachute is still closed.",
    "start": 4.54,
    "end": 6.21
   },
   {
    "text": "Gravity is still pulling you down.",
    "start": 7.1,
    "end": 9.28
   },
   {
    "text": "And somehow, you're slowing down.",
    "start": 10.0,
    "end": 12.35
   },
   {
    "text": "Wait, what?",
    "start": 13.47,
    "end": 14.57
   },
   {
    "text": "Did gravity change its mind?",
    "start": 15.26,
    "end": 17.07
   },
   {
    "text": "Did the air suddenly grow brakes?",
    "start": 18.46,
    "end": 20.77
   },
   {
    "text": "No, but the air is doing something surprisingly powerful.",
    "start": 22.27,
    "end": 26.37
   },
   {
    "text": "Imagine the fall, starting from rest.",
    "start": 27.88,
    "end": 30.33
   },
   {
    "text": "Up here, the air is thin.",
    "start": 31.7,
    "end": 33.77
   },
   {
    "text": "At first, gravity wins.",
    "start": 34.86,
    "end": 36.81
   },
   {
    "text": "You keep going faster.",
    "start": 37.74,
    "end": 39.32
   },
   {
    "text": "But as you fall, you're entering denser air.",
    "start": 40.62,
    "end": 43.79
   },
   {
    "text": "And here's where things get strange.",
    "start": 45.18,
    "end": 47.66
   },
   {
    "text": "The air pushes against you.",
    "start": 49.06,
    "end": 50.93
   },
   {
    "text": "And the faster you fall, the harder it pushes back.",
    "start": 51.42,
    "end": 54.83
   },
   {
    "text": "Eventually, in a simple model where your body position stays fixed, that upward push can actually become stronger than your weight.",
    "start": 56.29,
    "end": 65.67
   },
   {
    "text": "Think about that.",
    "start": 66.1,
    "end": 66.8
   },
   {
    "text": "You're still moving down.",
    "start": 68.14,
    "end": 69.71
   },
   {
    "text": "But the net force is now pointing up.",
    "start": 70.5,
    "end": 73.11
   },
   {
    "text": "So the downward speeds start to decrease.",
    "start": 74.1,
    "end": 77.83
   },
   {
    "text": "The speedometer drops, the ground gets closer.",
    "start": 79.22,
    "end": 83.4
   },
   {
    "text": "And your parachute is still closed.",
    "start": 84.04,
    "end": 86.22
   },
   {
    "text": "That's the strange part.",
    "start": 86.87,
    "end": 88.07
   },
   {
    "text": "Slowing down doesn't mean you have stopped falling.",
    "start": 89.5,
    "end": 92.2
   },
   {
    "text": "It means the air is pushing back, harder than gravity is pulling you down.",
    "start": 92.7,
    "end": 97.78
   },
   {
    "text": "But remember, this is a model, not a prediction for a real person.",
    "start": 99.01,
    "end": 103.78
   },
   {
    "text": "Change the posture or the conditions, and the results can change too.",
    "start": 104.38,
    "end": 108.56
   }
  ]
 },
